{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"中論校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"一.是書校勘分譯文與刻本爲二。譯文中本頌與長行典據不同．又各異其校例。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"二.是書本頌異文異譯甚多．今取六本對校．而略稱之例有八。（一）西藏譯中論本","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"頌本．略稱爲番。（二）西藏譯中論疏無畏論所牒之頌本．略稱爲無畏。（三）西藏","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"譯中論疏佛護論所牒之頌本．略稱爲佛護。（四）宋譯安慧中觀釋論所牒之頌","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"本．略稱爲釋。（五）唐譯清辨般若燈論所牒之頌本．略稱爲燈。（六）梵本月稱中","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"論疏所牒之頌本．略稱爲梵。（七）同本之西藏譯本．略稱爲月稱番本。（八）番釋","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"燈梵四種合擧．略稱爲四本。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"三.本頌之對校凡有三事。（一）品目。六本對校名稱不同者．悉爲註出曰．某本作某","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"品。同者不註。（二）次第。各頌先後．以數目字標明。六本對校次第不同者．悉爲註","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"出曰．某本雲雲。同者不註。其一頌中各句次第之對校．例同。（三）文義。今譯訛略","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"隱晦之處．悉依番梵二本爲主．餘本爲副．一一勘出．特爲註明．凡有五例．今擧對","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"校番梵二本之註爲式以概其餘。（甲）註一名一語曰．番梵作某某。（乙）註一句","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"數句曰．番梵雲雲。（丙）註一頌數頌曰．番梵頌雲雲。是等三註．依例尋文自知起","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"訖．不另標誌。（丁）上二例所註頌文均依意譯．仍五字句。其有不能句者．則散敘","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"之．而附註曰．勘番梵雲雲。（戊）釋燈二本勘有與番梵相符者．則註出曰．四本雲","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"四.是書長行無異文異譯．今旁資三本對校。（一）西藏譯無畏論．考爲是書所宗之","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"本。（二）西藏譯佛護論．（三）西藏譯月稱中論疏．二者考爲是書學說相近之本。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"三本略稱．皆如前例。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"五.長行之對校亦有三事。（一）章段。勘無畏論文分段有不同處．悉就本頌乙之。長","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"行隨頌自知段落．不別加註。（二）文句。今長行文勘有直接引用無畏論文者．均","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"用引號／／剔出。所引或有割裂刪減．皆隨文加號．不拘句讀。但勘今文有改飾","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"處．則據無畏論文註出曰．無畏原雲雲。有晦澀處．則據無畏論文註明曰．勘無畏","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"雲雲.或無畏意謂雲雲。有缺略處．則據無畏論文補註曰．無畏次雲雲。（三）異義。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"勘無畏論文有爲今文所未引用者．擇要註出曰．無畏釋雲雲。又無畏論文每段","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"生起．或問答．或復次．有與今文不同者．悉爲註出曰．無畏雲雲。又無畏論及今文","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"有處簡略解頌未明者．更勘佛護月稱之釋補註曰．佛護雲雲．月稱雲雲。","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"六.是書刻本依據南宋本．對校麗本及吉藏論疏所據之本．參證文義．確定爲奪誤","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"者．乃加改訂．附註曰．原刻雲雲．今依麗刻雲雲．疏本雲雲。有時存疑不改．亦附註","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"備考。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"七.是書校勘資料之版本出處如次。","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"（一）西藏譯中論本頌．Dbu-martsa-bah!itshig-leh!urbyas-pac#es-rabces-","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"bya-ba．德格版丹珠.tsa字函．一頁下至一九頁上。","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"（二）西藏譯中論疏無畏論．Dbu-martsa-bah!i　h!grel-paga-lush!jigs-med．","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"德格版丹珠．tsa字函．二九頁下至九九頁上。","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"（三）西藏譯中論疏佛護論．Dbu-martsa-bah!i　h!grel-pabuddhapalita．德格","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"版丹珠．tsa字函．一五八頁下至二八一頁上。","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"（四）宋譯安慧中觀釋論．金陵刻經處刊本。","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"（五）唐譯清辨般若燈論．金陵刻經處刊本。","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"（六）梵本月稱中論疏明句論．Madhayamakavr!tti(Prasannapada^)．聖彼得堡","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"版．佛教文庫本。","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"（七）西藏譯同論．Dbu-martsa-bah!ih!grel-patshiggsal-ba．德格版丹珠．h!a","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"字函．一頁下至二○○頁上。","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"（八）吉藏中觀論疏．金陵刻經處刊本。","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_108_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_108","text":"（九）本書之宋刻麗刻本．依日本弘教書院版正藏及大正大藏經之校註。","sortOrder":49}],"overrides":{}}